{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37740","headline":"作尉鄠郊送进士潘爲下第南归 · 郑谷","name":"作尉鄠郊送进士潘爲下第南归","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"归去宜春春水深，麦秋梅雨过湘阴。\n乡园几度经狂寇，桑柘谁家有旧林。\n结绶位卑甘晚达，登龙心在且高吟。\n灞陵桥上杨花里，酒满芳樽泪满襟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"郑谷","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_37740.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_37740","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}